% TR-056 (Hattori, Yokoi, "The Concepts and Facilities of SIMPOS Supervisor", ICOT TR-056, 84.04)
% PDF page 23, printed folio 21. Section 6(2) 'Directory' operations and pathname retrieval.
% Transcribed by eye from 300dpi code-line crops (work/tr0056/m*.png), F2 2026-11-23. Courier font: punctuation clear.
% Interface lines are printed one per bullet item, each under an 'o To ...' description (given as % comments).

% o To retrieve an object with name
            :find(Directory,Object,Name)
% o To add an object with name
            :bind(Directory,Object,Name)
% o To remove an object with name
            :remove(Directory,Object,Name)
% "a pathname can be represented as"
        "Name1>Name2>..."
% "and is used in a retrieve operation"
        :retrieve(Directory,Object,"Name1>Name2>...")
